        "subject": "fix(ui): use correct PR link in history view detail drawer (#1918)",
        "body": "* use correct PR link in history view detail drawer\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: resolve PR id/url as a single pair in history detail drawer\n\nPreviously the id and url were each resolved independently from\ncell.pullRequest and row, which could produce a mismatched pair or\nan anchor with a missing href.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>",
